{"translation-revision-date":"YEAR-MO-DA HO:MI+ZONE","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.12.0","source":"zip\/html5-video-player\/build\/onboarding.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"en","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"Use the block editor for new players":[""],"Adding a video with Gutenberg:":[""],"Open any post or page and type <strong>\/Video Player<\/strong> to insert the block":[""],"Add a <strong>Video File<\/strong>, <strong>YouTube<\/strong>, or <strong>Vimeo<\/strong> child block for your source":[""],"Set autoplay, mute, loop, poster image, and colors in the block sidebar":[""],"Adding a video with Elementor:":[""],"Edit a page with Elementor and search for <strong>HTML5 Video Player<\/strong>":[""],"Drag the widget into your layout, then pick a player or paste a video URL":[""],"Use the Style tab for spacing, background, and responsive visibility":[""],"Adding a video with a shortcode:":[""],"Go to <strong>Video Player &rsaquo; Add New Player<\/strong> and add your video source":[""],"Publish it, then copy the generated <code>[html5_video id=\"12\"]<\/code> shortcode":[""],"Paste that shortcode into any post, page, widget, or template file":[""],"Not sure yet? These are the three quickest routes:":[""],"Type <strong>\/Video Player<\/strong> in the block editor to insert the player block":[""],"Or go to <strong>Video Player &rsaquo; Add New Player<\/strong> and copy its shortcode":[""],"Welcome to HTML5 Video Player":[""],"Let\u2019s get your first video on the page. It takes about a minute, and everything you set here can be changed later.":[""],"HTML5 Video Player \u2014 short tutorial":[""],"Embed MP4, WebM, and OGG files, or a YouTube or Vimeo link":[""],"Match the player to your brand with skins and color customization":[""],"Add players with Gutenberg blocks, the Elementor widget, or a shortcode":[""],"Responsive, mobile-friendly, and SEO-optimized out of the box":[""],"Let's Get Started":[""],"Set your player defaults":[""],"Starting points for every new player. You can change all of them later under Video Player \u203a Settings.":[""],"Skip":[""],"Brand color":[""],"Accent color for the progress bar and controls":[""],"Play one video at a time":[""],"Starting a player pauses any other playing on the same page":[""],"Opens Add New Player in Gutenberg instead of the classic screen":[""],"Block editor for new players":[""],"With this on, <strong>Video Player &rsaquo; Add New Player<\/strong> opens in the Gutenberg block editor. You build the player from blocks \u2014 a Video File, YouTube, or Vimeo source \u2014 and set its options in the block sidebar.":[""],"With it off, new players open in the classic screen instead. Either way the player still gets a shortcode you can paste anywhere.":[""],"Which editor a player uses is recorded when that player is created, so changing this later only affects players you add from then on \u2014 existing ones keep opening in the editor they were built with.":[""],"What's included with HTML5 Video Player":[""],"Everything marked Included works right now on the free version. Pro unlocks the rest whenever you need it.":[""],"Upgrade to Pro":[""],"MP4, WebM & OGG, plus YouTube and Vimeo":[""],"Included":[""],"Embed a self-hosted file or paste a link \u2014 no re-encoding, no third-party account.":[""],"Skins & Color Customization":[""],"Match the player to your brand, and set autoplay, loop, and mute per video.":[""],"Gutenberg, Elementor & Shortcodes":[""],"Insert a player with a block, the Elementor widget, or a shortcode anywhere.":[""],"Responsive, Mobile & SEO Ready":[""],"Adapts to any screen, works across every major browser, and outputs video schema.":[""],"Multiple Subtitles & Quality Switcher":[""],"Pro":[""],"Multilingual captions, plus YouTube-style resolution and playback speed control.":[""],"Chapters, Watermark & Password Protection":[""],"Timestamp markers, your logo over the video, and gated private content.":[""],"And much more":[""],"Sticky on scroll, popup player, VAST ads, end screens, external hosting, and download control.":[""],"Last step \u2014 how will you add videos?":[""],"Pick how you usually build pages and the steps below will match. You can still use any of the other methods later.":[""],"Preferred method":[""],"Shortcode":[""],"Paste [html5_video id=\"...\"] into any post or widget":[""],"Gutenberg":[""],"Insert the Video Player block in the editor":[""],"Elementor":[""],"Drag the HTML5 Video Player widget into a section":[""],"Visit <strong>Video Player &rsaquo; Demo & Help<\/strong> any time for live demos":[""]}}}